WireGuard Client Export is a minimal companion for the official pfSense
WireGuard package. It provisions remote-access peers through the native
WireGuard package API and returns a one-time client configuration and QR code.

Client private keys are never persisted to the pfSense configuration, written
to disk, or logged. The package does not manage tunnels, firewall rules, NAT,
email delivery, telemetry, or background services.

WWW: https://github.com/sirius0/pfsense-pkg-wireguard-client-export
